[en.DECISION_C01_FORMAL_CONDEMN]
Reprimand §Y[FROM.GetName]§!

[en.DECISION_C01_FORMAL_CONDEMN_desc]
Independence activities are found in §Y[FROM.GetName]§!, the Equestria Empire Ministry of Order should set up a direct talk with the local government leader in the name of the Empress, to demand the correction of these improper behaviors.

[zh.DECISION_C01_FORMAL_CONDEMN]
斥责 §Y[FROM.GetName]§!

[zh.DECISION_C01_FORMAL_CONDEMN_desc]
在§Y[FROM.GetName]§!发现了独立活动，小马利亚帝国秩序部应该以女皇的名义直接约谈当地政府领导者，要求纠正这些不当行为。
